{
  "id": 75980383,
  "iid": 757,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Create protocols to the end of the TVB if length unknown upfront",
  "description": "Creating protocols with unknown length must be created to the end of the TVB\nfirst and reined back using proto_set_len() once the length becomes known.\nNot doing so can make indentification of problems harder and prevents analysis\nengines like MATE from properly processing the generated protocol trees.\nWith this change the remaining offending dissectors are corrected for this.\n\nCloses #16961",
  "state": "merged",
